    "deviation_notes": "STEWARD AUDIT (DRIFT-CRITIC 25% sample): downgraded EXACT->CLOSE. Engine chain fan-out DECAYS per hop (_CHAIN_DEFAULT_DECAY=0.7, primary+3 arcs default); PoE Arc GROWS damage per remaining chain (+15% more) across 7-10 hops. Scaling direction inverted + hop count compressed — the player of the original would feel pack-clear invert (engine chain strongest on first target; Arc strongest deep in the pack). Identity (chaining lightning bolt + sunder) intact. Quantitative mint-candidate ledgered: per-kit chain-decay override >1.0.",
