    "kit_id": "poe1-arc",
    "mapping_json": {
      "fidelity_notes": "Textbook-clean map: chain geometry is native (the engine's chain type IS the Arc identity, per the 2026-07-12 chain-geometry-rename that de-welded chain from lightning); per-chain damage growth is a chain-scaling property. FALSE-FRIEND handled: PoE shock = increased-damage-taken = engine SUNDER, NOT engine shock (which is paralysis-CC). The Shaper-of-Storms 'guaranteed shock' variant is guaranteed sunder application. Elementalist variant is the reference; Hierophant/Totem/Mines variants swap delivery chassis but keep the chain identity. t4 ELEMENTAL_ECHO for the mono-lightning amp; GEOMETRY_PROPAGATION_cascade candidate for the chain-as-propagation reading (noted alt). [STEWARD AUDIT AMENDMENT: per-chain damage GROWTH is NOT native — engine chain decays 0.7x/hop, default 3 arcs; grade CLOSE; quantitative mint-candidate (decay>1.0 override) ledgered in mint-candidates-batch-01.jsonl.]",
